 pour zoomer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Brmv8m9fY-MQ7kNvwFwmw-B&_nc_oc=AdqmoWgLw0JmELQMYpZD94U-qrq0n6TC3mTnKkRLPrUhuSr6VoSQqsIDIYpFGHUOA00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEdTvP5g75FXPGcVs49PkqybD8r0nfKEPYTK6CTEFnlTg&oe=6A8ECC74"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1lMMYFuU214Q7kNvwH9FcZ9&_nc_oc=AdpDwES3Q_y8KtDO-A1QFpgCeP0ce4gO5xOUKItutj8f4ouFlRmnU_JXRHzYaxYawIE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGgulcouosbuj4S2ap12SNpoq9Awom-szl7TJ1w4GjF0w&oe=6A8ECDD6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VkDiEU43a1cQ7kNvwHOzpJN&_nc_oc=Ado2iI3dIt5q8roQO-D4z6axY9uuN25gVaAxBmK0yHHH1fxABqv6-vALL2hc_Ze02l4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHSUW_rRXUfm-yvkGGuhSw7v4nZpccSJw6HZB2xk3GNDQ&oe=6A8EE2F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri":